  "body": "Positioned in a private setting, this spacious family home offers the space and flexibility modern families need.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four bedrooms, two bathrooms, a separate toilet, and two separate living areas, there's plenty of room for everyone to spread out and enjoy their own space. The separate kitchen and dining area connects easily to the patio and garden, while a dedicated living room provides additional space for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nA double internal access garage is complemented by generous off-street parking, with room for extra vehicles, visitors, a boat or trailer.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal are the shared swimming pool and tennis court facilities, delivering enviable lifestyle benefits without the cost of body corporate fees.\r\n\r\nPrivate, practical and family-friendly, this is a home that combines space, convenience and lifestyle in one attractive package.",
